{% assign litter = all_products['automatic-smart-cat-litter-box'] %}
{% assign camera_feeder = all_products['automatic-pet-feeder-with-camera'] %}
{% assign wifi_feeder = all_products['smart-automatic-pet-feeder-wifi-voice-control'] %}

<section class="hf-hero">
  <div class="hf-hero__copy reveal">
    <div class="hf-kicker">HAFHAFHAF / SMART PET LIVING</div>
    <h1>Better care.<br><span>Less to think about.</span></h1>
    <p>Smart feeding and hygiene essentials, chosen for modern homes and the people who love their pets.</p>
    <div class="hf-actions">
      <a class="hf-btn hf-btn--dark" href="#shop">Shop smart care</a>
      <a class="hf-link" href="#featured">See the collection <span>↘</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hf-hero__note"><span>01</span><span>Designed around real routines</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hf-hero__visual reveal">
    <div class="hf-hero__shape"></div>
    <div class="hf-hero__product">
      {% if litter.featured_image %}{{ litter.featured_image | image_url: width:1800 | image_tag: loading:'eager', widths:'700,1000,1300,1600,1800', sizes:'46vw', alt:litter.title }}{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="hf-hero__label"><span>01 / 04</span><strong>Automatic Smart Litter Box</strong><em>{{ litter.price | money }}</em></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hf-proof reveal">
  <div><strong>Smart routines</strong><span>Automate feeding & hygiene</span></div>
  <div><strong>Real products</strong><span>No decorative mockups</span></div>
  <div><strong>Clear choices</strong><span>A focused collection</span></div>
  <div><strong>Easy checkout</strong><span>Built for everyday buying</span></div>
</section>

<section class="hf-section" id="shop">
  <div class="hf-section__head reveal">
    <div><div class="hf-kicker">THE COLLECTION</div><h2>Smart essentials,<br><i>properly presented.</i></h2></div>
    <div class="hf-section__intro"><p>We keep the range tight: useful technology for feeding, monitoring and keeping the home clean.</p><a class="hf-link" href="/collections/all">View all products <span>→</span></a></div>
  </div>

  <div class="hf-product-grid" id="featured">
    {% for product in collections.all.products limit:8 %}
      <article class="hf-card reveal" style="--delay:{{ forloop.index | times: 60 }}ms">
        <a class="hf-card__media hf-tone-{{ forloop.index | modulo: 4 }}" href="{{ product.url }}">
          <span class="hf-card__index">0{{ forloop.index }}</span>
          {% if product.featured_image %}{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width:1200 | image_tag: loading:'lazy', widths:'500,700,900,1200', sizes:'(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:1000px) 33vw, 25vw', alt:product.title }}{% endif %}
          <span class="hf-card__arrow">↗</span>
        </a>
        <div class="hf-card__info">
          <div class="hf-card__name"><a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a><span>{{ product.price | money }}</span></div>
          {% assign rating = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating %}{% assign rating_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value %}
          <div class="hf-rating">
            {% if rating_count and rating_count > 0 %}<span class="hf-stars">★★★★★</span><span>{{ rating | round:1 }}</span><a href="{{ product.url }}#reviews">{{ rating_count }} reviews</a>{% else %}<span class="hf-stars hf-stars--empty">★★★★★</span><a href="{{ product.url }}#reviews">Be the first to review</a>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hf-story">
  <div class="hf-story__visual reveal">
    <div class="hf-story__backdrop"></div>
    {% if camera_feeder.featured_image %}{{ camera_feeder.featured_image | image_url: width:1600 | image_tag: loading:'lazy', widths:'700,1000,1300,1600', sizes:'50vw', alt:camera_feeder.title }}{% endif %}
    <span class="hf-float">CONNECTED CARE / 02</span>
  </div>
  <div class="hf-story__copy reveal">
    <div class="hf-kicker">THE IDEA</div>
    <h2>Technology that<br><i>earns its space.</i></h2>
    <p>Pet products shouldn't look like gadgets dropped into your living room. We focus on quiet, useful technology with a clear purpose.</p>
    <div class="hf-points"><div><b>01</b><span>Automate repetitive tasks.</span></div><div><b>02</b><span>Keep an eye on routines from anywhere.</span></div><div><b>03</b><span>Choose products that belong in the home.</span></div></div>
    <a class="hf-link" href="/pages/about">Why HafHafHaf <span>→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hf-feature">
  <div class="hf-feature__copy reveal">
    <div class="hf-kicker">THE ONE TO START WITH</div>
    <h2>A cleaner litter<br><i>routine.</i></h2>
    <p>Automatic cleaning, contained waste and less daily maintenance — built around a calmer home.</p>
    <div class="hf-feature__price">{{ litter.price | money }} <small>automatic litter system</small></div>
    <a class="hf-btn hf-btn--light" href="{{ litter.url }}">Explore the litter box</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hf-feature__visual reveal">
    {% if litter.images[1] %}{{ litter.images[1] | image_url: width:1800 | image_tag: loading:'lazy', widths:'700,1000,1300,1600,1800', sizes:'55vw', alt:litter.title }}{% elsif litter.featured_image %}{{ litter.featured_image | image_url: width:1800 | image_tag: loading:'lazy', widths:'700,1000,1300,1600,1800', sizes:'55vw', alt:litter.title }}{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hf-benefits hf-section">
  <div class="hf-section__head reveal"><div><div class="hf-kicker">WHY SHOP HAFHAFHAF</div><h2>Simple, useful,<br><i>considered.</i></h2></div></div>
  <div class="hf-benefit-grid">
    <div class="hf-benefit hf-benefit--cream reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Focused range</h3><p>We'd rather have ten useful products than a thousand forgettable ones.</p></div>
    <div class="hf-benefit hf-benefit--yellow reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Made for routines</h3><p>Feeding, monitoring and hygiene — the things pet parents actually repeat.</p></div>
    <div class="hf-benefit hf-benefit--blue reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Clear information</h3><p>Specifications, variants, pricing and reviews stay close to the decision.</p></div>
    <div class="hf-benefit hf-benefit--green reveal"><span>04</span><h3>Real customer proof</h3><p>Reviews belong to real customers. We never manufacture social proof.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hf-quote reveal">
  <div class="hf-quote__mark">“</div>
  <p>Good pet technology should disappear into the routine — leaving more attention for the pet, not the task.</p>
  <span>THE HAFHAFHAF STANDARD</span>
</section>

<section class="hf-newsletter reveal">
  <div><div class="hf-kicker">NOTES FROM HAFHAFHAF</div><h2>Useful ideas.<br><i>No inbox noise.</i></h2></div>
  {% form 'customer' %}<input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter"><div class="hf-newsletter__form"><input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="Your email address" aria-label="Your email address" required><button type="submit">Join <span>→</span></button></div>{% endform %}
</section>

